===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*deyḱ-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|to}}, from {{inh|en|ang|tā}}, (Mercian) {{m|ang|tāhe}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*taihā}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*taihwǭ}}, from {{m|gem-pro|*tīhwaną||to show, announce}}, from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*deyḱ-|t=to show}}.

See also {{cog|nl|teen}}, {{cog|de|Zehe}}, {{cog|da|tå}}, {{cog|sv|tå}}; also   {{cog|ang|teōn||to accuse}}, {{cog|de|zeihen||to accuse, blame}}; also {{cog|hit|||tr=tekkuššāi}}, {{cog|la|dīcere||to say}}, {{m|la|digitus||finger}}, {{cog|grc|δείκνυμι||to point out, show}}, {{cog|sa|दिदेष्टि||tr=dídeṣṭi}}, {{m|sa|दिशति||tr=diśáti}}.

